@page
@model Main.Pages.Games.GoreberekModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Goreberek";
}


In a world dominated by gigacorporations, humanity is led by Nustlé - a pioneer of child labor and the exploitation of man in every possible way.

Your mission - Fight evil at its source. You are Goreberek - the first of a hundred experimental subjects posing as a child's pet. Your goal is to get rid of Gorber's main workforce and consumers - Nustlé's youngest employees. You must remain vigilant - the slightest mistake can mean the disgrace of the entire enterprise.

Remember - the success of your mission will determine the fall of the empire.


